Pending content immutable; not an approval"];auth[label="Review permission + calendar CAS + gate
Global leave: business-wide approval
Closure: permitted branch approval"];decision[label="Approve requested?",shape=diamond];deny[label="Append REJECTED successor
Keep original evidence; does not block publication"];conflict[label="Overlap with retained published shift?",shape=diamond];fail[label="Yes -> EXCEPTION_SHIFT_CONFLICT
Rollback, preserve pending request
