Reviewer identity + immutable interval
One successor per root"];block[label="Later publication checks effective block
Same global staff for leave / branch for closure
No silent shift or customer cancellations"];legacy[label="Legacy exception -> LEGACY_UNREVIEWED
Blocks conservatively until explicit review
Never infer approval from old nullable field"];request->auth->decision;decision->deny[label="no"];decision->conflict[label="yes"];conflict->fail[label="yes"];conflict->approve[label="no"];approve->block;legacy->auth;}
